From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rtl8188eus: adapt the cfg80211 ops to Linux 7.3

Add 7.3 wrappers for the wireless_dev, radio_idx, link_id and scalar
ROC/mgmt-tx cookie ABI, update the station notifications, and replace
strncpy.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
